('TRGG-GUEST-0437', 'Inggall, Kenny', 'en', 'caddy_booking', 'Can I book my caddy for Siam Plantation in the app?', 'Playing Siam Plantation with the Travellers Rest Golf Group on 7 Oct, off at 11:00. Is there a way to book caddy 35 through MyCaddiPro instead of ringing the course? The phone is a lottery.', 'Travellers Rest Golf Group', 'in_progress', 'normal', 'Collecting these per course to take to the pro shop.', NULL, NULL, 'seed_wave3_20261003', '2026-10-03 13:30:49+07', '2026-10-03 13:49:20+07'),
('Udb12b92d028efee5a017a03a6c4c1ad4', 'Jason Kang', 'en', 'other', 'I''ve stopped playing Hermes', 'Not because of the course — the booking. Their phone line and their LINE are both useless. 30 Sep was the last straw: confirmed on the phone, nothing in the book when we arrived. Put Hermes in the app and I''d play it every week.', 'JOA Golf Pattaya', 'resolved', 'high', NULL, '2026-10-03 13:56:00+07', 'U2b6d976f19bca4b2f4374ae0e10ed873', 'seed_wave3_20261003', '2026-10-03 12:53:26+07', '2026-10-03 13:56:00+07'),
('TRGG-GUEST-1173', 'Moss, Ray', 'en', 'caddy_booking', 'Book caddy 74 at Khao Kheow via the app?', 'Last time at Khao Kheow I had caddy 74 and she was excellent. I''d like her again on 9 Oct. Can that request go through MyCaddiPro so it actually reaches the caddy master?', 'Travellers Rest Golf Group', 'open', 'normal', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'seed_wave3_20261003', '2026-10-03 12:01:30+07', '2026-10-03 12:01:30+07'),
('TRGG-GUEST-1173', 'Moss, Ray', 'en', 'other', 'Lost cause booking at Burapha', 'Spent Friday trying to book Burapha for the Travellers Rest Golf Group and gave up. Playing elsewhere that week. The course is good, the phone booking is a joke. This is exactly what the app should fix.', 'Travellers Rest Golf Group', 'open', 'normal', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'seed_wave3_20261003', '2026-10-03 10:25:13+07', '2026-10-03 10:25:13+07'),
('U3920142e22dc56dadb2ac3eac53ccf7f', 'Johns, Colin', 'en', 'other', 'Slow play Phoenix', 'Phoenix on 1 Oct: 6 hours. The app''s pace clock had us 40 minutes behind by the turn. Course has no marshals and the caddies just shrug. Is there anything MyCaddiPro can show the course?', 'Travellers Rest Golf Group', 'in_progress', 'high', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'seed_wave3_20261003', '2026-10-03 10:01:29+07', '2026-10-03 12:32:37+07'),
