('TRGG-GUEST-0514', 'Kemp, Brett', 'en', 'other', 'Why is Laem Chabang so slow?', 'Every Travellers Rest Golf Group day at Laem Chabang is 6 hours now. It wasn''t like this last year. The groups in front weren''t even ours. Can you ask them what''s changed?', 'Travellers Rest Golf Group', 'resolved', 'high', 'Logged for the course meeting. Reporter told.', '2026-09-27 13:19:15+07', 'U2b6d976f19bca4b2f4374ae0e10ed873', 'seed_wave3_20261003', '2026-09-25 12:38:31+07', '2026-09-27 13:29:15+07'),
